{"ref":"BDB, תַּחְתּוֹן","hw":"תַּחְתּוֹן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">תַּחְתּוֹן</span></big>  <strong>adj. lower, lowest</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">תּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 16:3\" href=\"/Joshua.16.3\">Jos 16:3</a> +, fs. -<span dir=\"rtl\">תֹּנָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.9\">Is 22:9</a> +, fpl. -<span dir=\"rtl\">תֹּנֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 42:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.42.5\">Ez 42:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 42:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.42.6\">6</a>;—<em>lower</em>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.9\">Is 22:9</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">הַבְּרֵכָה הַתּ׳</span> the <em>lower</em> pool (in Jerus.), of pavement and gate of outer (lower) temple-court <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.18\">Ez 40:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:19\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.19\">19</a> (l. <span dir=\"rtl\">השּׁ׳ הַתַּחְתּוֹן</span>), of <em>lower</em> ledge <span dir=\"rtl\">(עֲזָרְה)</span> of altar, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 43:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.43.14\">43:14</a>; of the <em>lowest</em> of the three stories of side-chambers surrounding the temple, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:6\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.6\">1 K 6:6</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">הַיָּצוּעַ הַתּ׳</span>, + v <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:8\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.8\">8a</a> (v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, תִּיכוֹן²\" href=\"/BDB,_תִּיכוֹן²\", dir=\"rtl\">תִּיכוֹן</a>), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 41:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.41.7\">Ez 41:7</a> (read <span dir=\"rtl\">וּמִן</span> for <span dir=\"rtl\">וְכֵן</span>), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 42:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.42.5\">42:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 42:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.42.6\">6</a>; in place-name, <span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּית־חֹרוֹן תּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 16:3\" href=\"/Joshua.16.3\">Jos 16:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:13\" href=\"/Joshua.18.13\">18:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 9:17\" href=\"/I_Kings.9.17\">1 K 9:17</a> (‖ <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 8:5\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.8.5\">2 Ch 8:5</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">הַתּ׳</span>), <span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּית־חֹרוֹן הַתּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:24\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.24\">1 Ch 7:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 8:5\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.8.5\">2 Ch 8:5</a>.","next":"BDB, תַּחְתִּי","prev":"BDB, תַּ֫חַת"}